v 3
d fevc: KSS point estimates, structured observation-deletion component inference, and block projections
d Also explicit fixed-offset match q0/q1 inference, omitting nuisance-control estimation uncertainty.
d GPL-3.0-only prerelease package with precompiled native backends.
